\n<tr>\n<td>Naphtal\xc3\xa8ne </td>\n<td>\xc2\xb5g/l </td>\n<td>0,5 </td>\n<td>\xc2\xa0 </td>\n<td>\xc2\xa024</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Autres HAP </td>\n<td>\xc2\xb5g/l </td>\n<td>0,005 </td>\n<td>\xc2\xa0 </td>\n<td>\xc2\xa0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A.O.X. </td>\n<td>\xc2\xb5g Cl/l </td>\n<td>10 </td>\n<td>\xc2\xa0 </td>\n<td>\xc2\xa0100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PCB\'s (7 Ballschmiter) </td>\n<td>\xc2\xb5g/l </td>\n<td>0,01 </td>\n<td>\xc2\xa0 </td>\n<td>\xc2\xa0</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<p class="centrer" style="text-align: justify">Vu pour \xc3\xaatre annex\xc3\xa9 \xc3\xa0 l\'arr\xc3\xaat\xc3\xa9 du \r\nGouvernement wallon 27 f\xc3\xa9vrier 2003 fixant les conditions sectorielles \r\nd\'exploitation des centres d\'enfouissement technique.<b>]</b><br/>\n<b>[A.G.W. 07.10.2010]</b></p>\n<p class="centrer">__________________</p>\n<p class="centrer"><strong>[Annexe 5</strong></p>\n<p class="centrer"><b>\xc2\xa0Mode de calcul de la s\xc3\xbbret\xc3\xa9 </b></p>\n<p class="justifie">1. Remise en \xc3\xa9tat provisoire du site apr\xc3\xa8s exploitation du \r\nCET</p>\n<table border="1" bordercolor="#111111" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="3" style="border-collapse: collapse" width="100%">\n<tr>\n<th width="260">Poste </th>\n<th width="249">Commentaires </th>\n<th width="69">\xc2\xa0 </th>\n<th width="46">\xc2\xa0Unit\xc3\xa9s </th>\n<th width="57">Quantit\xc3\xa9 </th>\n<th width="83">Prix unitaires <br/>\r\n    (euro HTVA) </th>\n<th width="40">Prix total</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width="260">A. Couverture provisoire </td>\n<td width="249">Au niveau des cellules qui ont \xc3\xa9t\xc3\xa9 en exploitation (1) </td>\n<td width="69">\xc2\xa0 </td>\n<td width="46">\xc2\xa0 </td>\n<td width="57">\xc2\xa0 </td>\n<td width="83">\xc2\xa0 </td>\n<td width="40">\xc2\xa0 </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan="2" width="260">A1. Couverture interm\xc3\xa9diaire </td>\n<td width="249">Alternative 1 : mise en oeuvre avec fourniture des mat\xc3\xa9riaux </td>\n<td width="69">S x 0,15 m </td>\n<td width="4